      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Environment Lighting is the light with no source: where no light reaches, it is the only light. <b>Source</b>: Skybox (the sky's colours) \xB7 Gradient (Sky, Equator and Ground Color) \xB7 Color (one colour).\n\n<b>Predict:</b> 1. You set the ambient to black. What happens to the sides in shadow? 2. Source Gradient, with a red Ground Color. Which faces turn red?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Night is a low ambient, not zero. Set Source to Color: first black, then a dark blue (R 25, G 35, B 60). Compare the sides in shadow and the roof over this camera.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Lighting window \u203A Environment \u203A Environment Lighting</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
